--- !u!114 &258034779
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 258034777}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 45ff4a1c579569947a05b76f63e4ca8b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::C_TutorialManager
  tutorialEnabled: 1
  allowTutorialSkip: 1
  rememberCompletion: 1
  steps:
  - title: Meet Pip !
    description: 'Hey! I''m Pip!

      I''ll be your guide while we learn the basics
      of running a wasp colony.

      Just stick with me, and we''ll take it one
      step at a time!'
    requiresManualContinue: 1
    showContinueButton: 1
  - title: Welcome to Vespidae !
    description: Our job is to help this native wasp colony survive, expand, and
      compete against invasive species. Don't worry,we'll build our colony one step
      at a time.
    requiresManualContinue: 1
    showContinueButton: 1
  - title: Explore the Map
    description: 'Let''s start by getting familiar with our surroundings.


      Move
      your cursor around the edges of the screen to pan across the map. A good scout
      always knows what''s happening nearby'
    requiresManualContinue: 1
    showContinueButton: 1
  - title: Our Home
    description: 'There it is! That''s our home!

      Click on the yellow hex to
      select it. Every new adventure starts here, and soon we''ll begin expanding
      our colony into the surrounding territory.'
    requiresManualContinue: 1
    showContinueButton: 1
  - title: The Hive
    description: 'Great! Now click on our hive in the centre of the yellow hex.

      The
      hive is the heart of our colony. This is where you''ll train new wasps and
      keep track of how many workers you have available.'
    requiresManualContinue: 1
    showContinueButton: 1
  - title: Training New Wasps
    description: 'This panel lets you grow your colony by training different types
      of wasps.

      Each role has its own purpose, so choosing the right workers
      is just as important as gathering resources.'
    requiresManualContinue: 1
    showContinueButton: 1
  - title: Meet Your Workers
    description: "Here's a quick overview of each role:\n\U0001F7E1 Scouts explore
      unknown territory. \n\U0001F7E2 Foragers gather Nectar and Prey.\n\U0001F535Builders
      strengthen and expand the colony.\n\U0001F534 Attackers defend the hive and
      engage enemy forces."
    requiresManualContinue: 1
    showContinueButton: 1
  - title: Returning to the Map
    description: 'Great job!

      Whenever you want to return to the main map,
      simply click the Return button in the bottom-right corner of the screen.

      If
      you ever feel stuck in a closeup view, this button will always bring you back.'
    requiresManualContinue: 1
    showContinueButton: 1
  - title: Your First Scout
    description: 'Nice work! I''ve already prepared your very first Scout, so we''re
      ready to begin exploring.

      Let''s discover what''s waiting beyond our
      territory!'
    requiresManualContinue: 1
    showContinueButton: 1
  - title: Scouting New Territory
    description: 'See those orange hexes? They represent unknown territory.


      Click
      on one to select it, then choose Send Scout to begin scouting the area.'
    requiresManualContinue: 1
    showContinueButton: 1
  - title: Waiting for Intel
    description: 'Great choice!

      Your Scout is now on the move. It will take
      a little time to survey the area and report back.

      Sit tight, we''ll
      know what''s out there soon enough.'
    requiresManualContinue: 1
    showContinueButton: 1
  - title: Scout Report Complete
    description: 'Great work! Our Scout has returned with valuable information.

      The
      territory has now been revealed, and we can decide whether it''s worth claiming
      for the colony.'
    requiresManualContinue: 1
    showContinueButton: 1
  - title: Claim New Territory
    description: 'Our Scout has finished its survey!


      Click on the newly discovered
      hex and choose Claim Land to make it part of our colony.'
    requiresManualContinue: 1
    showContinueButton: 1
  - title: Expanding the Colony
    description: "Excellent work! \nEvery territory we claim strengthens our colony
      and rewards us with valuable resources that can be used to train more workers."
    requiresManualContinue: 1
    showContinueButton: 1
  - title: Keep Expanding
    description: 'The more territory we control, the stronger our colony becomes.

      Continue
      scouting and claiming nearby hexes until you''ve gathered enough resources
      to train your first Forager.'
    requiresManualContinue: 1
    showContinueButton: 1
  - title: A New Worker
    description: 'Nice work! We''ve gathered enough resources.

      Return to the
      hive and train your first Forager. Foragers collect the resources our colony
      needs to continue growing.'
    requiresManualContinue: 1
    showContinueButton: 1
  - title: Expand the Colony
    description: "You're doing great! \nKeep scouting and claiming new territory.
      Once we've gathered enough resources, we'll train Builders to construct new
      hives and expand our colony even faster."
    requiresManualContinue: 1
    showContinueButton: 1
  tutorialPanel: {fileID: 889767111}
  titleText: {fileID: 1673824013}
  descriptionText: {fileID: 929689043}
  continueButton: {fileID: 346908190}
  skipButton: {fileID: 386505872}
  alwaysShowTutorialInEditor: 1
